  "pal_park_encounters": [],
  "form_descriptions": [],
  "flavor_text_entries": [
    {
      "flavor_text": "おおぐらいだが　エサを　とるのはにがて。　シャリタツと　コンビをくんで　えものを　とらえるのだ。",
      "language": {
        "name": "ja-hrkt",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/1/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "scarlet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/40/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "대식가지만 먹이를 잡는 것이 서툴다. 싸리용과 콤비를 이뤄 먹이를 사냥한다.",
      "language": {
        "name": "ko",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/3/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "scarlet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/40/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "雖然是個大胃王，但不擅長捕食。會和米立龍聯手捕捉獵物。",
      "language": {
        "name": "zh-hant",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/4/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "scarlet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/40/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Comme il n’est pas très doué pour attraper ses proies, ce Pokémon vorace fait équipe avec Nigirigon pour chasser.",
      "language": {
        "name": "fr",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/5/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "scarlet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/40/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Es ist zwar ein Vielfraß, doch die Jagd liegt ihm nicht. Deshalb schließt es sich mit Nigiragi zusammen, um Beute zu fangen.",
      "language": {
        "name": "de",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/6/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "scarlet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/40/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Le gusta mucho comer, pero no se le da bien cazar, por lo que aúna fuerzas con Tatsugiri con el fin de capturar presas.",
      "language": {
        "name": "es",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/7/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "scarlet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/40/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "È un Pokémon vorace, ma non è molto abile nel procacciarsi il cibo. Cattura le sue prede collaborando con il Tatsugiri che è con lui.",
      "language": {
        "name": "it",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/8/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "scarlet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/40/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "This Pokémon is a glutton, but it’s bad at getting food. It teams up with a Tatsugiri to catch prey.",
      "language": {
        "name": "en",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/9/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "scarlet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/40/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "大食らいだが　エサを　取るのは苦手。　シャリタツと　コンビを組んで　獲物を　捕らえるのだ。",
      "language": {
        "name": "ja",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/11/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "scarlet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/40/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "虽然是个大胃王，却不怎么擅长捕食。会和米立龙联手捕捉猎物。",
      "language": {
        "name": "zh-hans",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/12/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "scarlet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/40/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Le gusta mucho comer, pero no se le da bien cazar, por lo que aúna fuerzas con Tatsugiri con el fin de capturar presas.",
      "language": {
        "name": "es-419",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/14/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "scarlet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/40/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "シャリタツを　おやぶんのようにしたっている。　ちからもちだがあたまは　あまり　よくないらしい。",
      "language": {
        "name": "ja-hrkt",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/1/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/41/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "싸리용을 두목처럼 모신다. 힘 하나는 천하장사지만 머리는 그다지 좋지 못하다고 한다.",
      "language": {
        "name": "ko",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/3/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/41/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "將米立龍當成頭領般敬重。雖然是個大力士，但頭腦似乎不是很聰明。",
      "language": {
        "name": "zh-hant",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/4/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/41/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Il semblerait que ce puissant Pokémon ne se distingue pas par son intelligence. Il considère Nigirigon comme son supérieur.",
      "language": {
        "name": "fr",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/5/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/41/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Dieses Pokémon ist sehr stark, aber anscheinend nicht besonders schlau. Es ist Nigiragi treu ergeben, so als wäre dieses sein Anführer.",
      "language": {
        "name": "de",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/6/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/41/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Idolatra a Tatsugiri y lo trata como a un líder. Posee una fuerza descomunal, pero no destaca precisamente por su gran intelecto.",
      "language": {
        "name": "es",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/7/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/41/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "È molto forte, ma non sembra essere particolarmente intelligente. Adora il Tatsugiri che è con lui e lo considera il suo capo.",
      "language": {
        "name": "it",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/8/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/41/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "It treats Tatsugiri like its boss and follows it loyally. Though powerful, Dondozo is apparently not very smart.",
      "language": {
        "name": "en",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/9/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/41/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "シャリタツを　親分のように慕っている。　力持ちだが頭は　あまり　良くないらしい。",
      "language": {
        "name": "ja",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/11/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/41/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "把米立龙当作头领般敬重。虽然是个大力士，但头脑似乎不是很聪明。",
      "language": {
        "name": "zh-hans",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/12/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/41/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Idolatra a Tatsugiri y lo trata como a un líder. Posee una fuerza descomunal, pero no destaca precisamente por su gran intelecto.",
      "language": {
